{{/* poster: the fixed 48×72 (2:3) cover slot. Takes a Poster. Three
     variants: the image, lazy and sized so the row never shifts, on a plain
     block that shows while it loads; the missing box (dashed hairline and an
     image-off mark) when Jellyfin has no poster; and the generated
     placeholder, the title's initial on a plain block. The image's alt is
     the title; the other two are decorative, since the row names the item. */}}
{{define "poster"}}{{if .Src}}<div class="poster"><img class="poster__image" src="{{.Src}}" alt="{{.Title}}" width="48" height="72" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div>
{{- else if .Missing}}<div class="poster poster--missing" aria-hidden="true"><svg class="poster__missing-mark" viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1" focusable="false"><rect x="0.5" y="0.5" width="11" height="11"/><path d="M0.5 0.5l11 11"/></svg></div>
{{- else}}<div class="poster poster--placeholder" aria-hidden="true"><span class="poster__initial">{{.Initial}}</span></div>{{end}}{{end}}
